{
  "description": "同一文档多项普通编辑可用 batch；课件已确定的跨页布局和对象插入成批提交，软件维护身份并一次校验提交与撤销。operations使用当前各工具的实际输入和已观察目标，目标沿本任务ACK续用，不逐对象重新遍历。单项正文直接调用 text.replace 可逐步显示生成内容。条目的 name 使用下列规范工具名，input 使用该工具定义的实际参数；执行时每项仍经规范解析器校验。跨文档须分别调用。",
  "inputSchema": {
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "operations": {
        "items": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "input": {
              "additionalProperties": true,
              "description": "对应 name 的规范工具输入。",
              "type": "object"
            },
            "name": {
              "enum": [
                "text.replace",
                "text.format",
                "object.update",
                "media.apply",
                "media.insert",
                "object.convert",
                "presentation.update",
                "course.configure",
                "surface.configure",
                "object.structure",
                "object.place",
                "object.author",
                "interaction.update",
                "course.logic",
                "course.media",
                "surface.duplicate",
                "surface.recipe",
                "course.productivity",
                "surface.remix",
                "object.insert",
                "object.layout",
                "teacher.ensure"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "name",
            "input"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        "minItems": 1,
        "type": "array"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "operations"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "静态目录只说明已登记接口；当前运行是否可调用、文档范围、写权限、短句柄和服务配置，以宿主本轮发现与实际回执为准。",
  "manual": {
    "group": "edit",
    "label": "批量修改",
    "targetKinds": [
      "markdown-range",
      "html-author-field",
      "course-instance",
      "text-selection"
    ]
  },
  "name": "batch",
  "version": 1
}
